[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12001.269, "timestamp": "03:20:01", "text": "音樂導致了一場死亡。  來啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12008.59, "timestamp": "03:20:08", "text": "我沒那麼多時間。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12022.389, "timestamp": "03:20:22", "text": "哇，這種遊戲玩法真有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12044.71, "timestamp": "03:20:44", "text": "完成這件事，這樣我才能……我的天哪，這是轟炸。我在看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12049.51, "timestamp": "03:20:49", "text": "什麼"}]